          "meaning": "Kabandha, sentence, said.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3.70.2",
      "label": "3.70.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "तिष्ठतः किम् नु माम् दृष्ट्वा क्षुधा आर्तम् क्षत्रिय ऋषभौ |\nआहार अर्थम् तु सन्दिष्टौ दैवेन गत चेतसौ",
      "iast": "tiṣṭhataḥ kim nu mām dṛṣṭvā kṣudhā ārtam kṣatriya ṛṣabhau |\nāhāra artham tu sandiṣṭau daivena gata cetasau",
      "translation": "\"Oh, excellent Kshatriya-s, on seeing me who am miserably famished, really what for you stay cool? You are the godsend gobs of mine, and hence now you are almost dead...\" So said Kabandha to brothers.",
