    {
      "id": "3.70.9",
      "label": "3.70.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "दक्षिणो दक्षिणम् बाहुम् असक्तम् असिना ततः |\nचिच्छेद रामो वेगेन सव्यम् वीरः तु लक्ष्मणः",
      "iast": "dakṣiṇo dakṣiṇam bāhum asaktam asinā tataḥ |\nciccheda rāmo vegena savyam vīraḥ tu lakṣmaṇaḥ",
      "translation": "Then that dextrous Rama with an unrestrained speed hacked off the right arm, and valiant Lakshmana on his part hewed down the left arm that speedily.",
