    {
      "id": "3.70.11",
      "label": "3.70.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "स निकृत्तौ भुजौ दृष्ट्वा शोणित ओघ परिप्लुतः |\nदीनः पप्रच्छ तौ वीरौ कौ युवाम् इति दानवः",
      "iast": "sa nikṛttau bhujau dṛṣṭvā śoṇita ogha pariplutaḥ |\ndīnaḥ papraccha tau vīrau kau yuvām iti dānavaḥ",
      "translation": "That demon on seeing at his dissevered shoulders on which the gushes of blood are overflowing, he self-piteously asked those two bold ones thus as, \"who are you...\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
