    {
      "id": "3.70.13",
      "label": "3.70.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "अयम् इक्ष्वाकु दायादो रामो नाम जनैः श्रुतः |\nतस्य एव अवरजम् विद्धि भ्रातरम् माम् च लक्ष्मणम्",
      "iast": "ayam ikṣvāku dāyādo rāmo nāma janaiḥ śrutaḥ |\ntasya eva avarajam viddhi bhrātaram mām ca lakṣmaṇam",
      "translation": "\"He is known to people by the name of Rama, the legatee of Ikshvaku dynasty, and you know me as his younger brother, Lakshmana, by my name...",
