    {
      "id": "3.70.14",
      "label": "3.70.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "मात्रा प्रतिहतो राज्ये रामः प्रवाजितो वनम् |\nमया सह चरति एष भार्यया च महत् वनम्",
      "iast": "mātrā pratihato rājye rāmaḥ pravājito vanam |\nmayā saha carati eṣa bhāryayā ca mahat vanam",
      "translation": "\"Countervailed from kingdom by mother this Rama is bluntly sent to forests, and he is on the rove in great forests along with me ad his wife...",
      "notes": [],
