    {
      "id": "3.70.15",
      "label": "3.70.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "अस्य देव प्रभावस्य वसतो विजने वने |\nरक्षसा अपहृता भार्या याम् इच्छन्तौ इह आगतौ",
      "iast": "asya deva prabhāvasya vasato vijane vane |\nrakṣasā apahṛtā bhāryā yām icchantau iha āgatau",
      "translation": "\"A demon stole his wife while he whose leverage is like that of god is living in the unpopulated forest... and wishing to retrieve her we came here...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "vi jane vane",
          "iast": "vi jane vane",
          "devanagari": "वि जने वने",
          "meaning": "without, people, in forest",
